OL,3,GNEWSAMonitored sex offender shared baby
OL,4,Aabuse videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted and monitored sex offender
OL,7,Fhas been jailed for four years after
OL,8,Fcommitting a further series of crimes,
OL,9,Fincluding sharing a video online of
OL,10,Fbabies being sexually abused.
OL,12,FConnor Saggers, 26, from Cumbria, who
OL,13,Fadmitted 11 new offences committed
OL,14,Fbetween last summer and this May,
OL,15,Fadopted a female user name and
OL,16,Fparticipated in abuse forums attracting
OL,17,Fbetween 100 and 1,400 members.
