OL,3,GNEWSAMonitored sex offender shared baby
OL,4,Aabuse videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarlisle Crown Court heard Saggers
OL,7,Fshared intimate images of a woman and
OL,8,Fsent abuse videos showing victims from
OL,9,Fvery young babies to children thought
OL,10,Fto be aged about six to eight.
OL,12,FProsecutor Emelia Boyle said: "When
OL,13,Fsending in one of these videos, the
OL,14,Fdefendant wrote he had found the
OL,15,F'perfect video'."
